{"server":"en","storyId":"act5d0_level_act5d0_05_beg","groupId":"act5d0","stageId":"act5d0_05","title":"8:31P.M.","storyCode":"CB-5","avgTag":"Before Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_05_beg.txt","sourceHash":"3ccf4abf9fac1d142a1c7c9040c1205faf6ce93a551ffc0ee60f934180f94634","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二关（前）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"Yahoo!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Eyes on the road, Exusiai! Hands on ten and two!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"I finally caught you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sora","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"Texas... please... slower next time..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"S- sorry. I was holding back as much as I could."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"But at least we're all back together. Now we gotta go find the boss."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"Wait, why do I feel like we're missing something?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"Huh?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"...where's Bison?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"What? Wasn't he with you guys?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sora","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"...We didn't leave him back there did we?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"...We're so used to doing things our own way, leaving him behind was kind of inevitable."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sora","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"So then we should probably go back and get him?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"Isn't Mostima here? I think he'll be okay."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Bison","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"Hey! W- waait up! *Cough* *hack*"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sora","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"...A bicycle?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Wowee! If you'n keep up with Texas on a bicycle, yer somethin' else, Bison!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mafioso","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Hey! Which alley'd he go down?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mafioso","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"That way!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"He's got a lot of guys on his tail."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"Let's not be too hard on the kid who shook off a crew of armed mobsters on a bicycle."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"...No, it's an ambush. Exusiai!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"A little late for that!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Bison","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"Nng!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Bison","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"I did it! I caught them!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gambino","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Sure did. Thanks for leading the way."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Bison","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"Who——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gambino","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"Good night, sweet prince."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Bison","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"Oof."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"Damn. A second too late."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gambino","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"Good evening, Penguin Logistics. I am Gambino Ricci, head of the Family."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gambino","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"And it looks like I've got a hostage."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gambino","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"But you ain't gonna make a scene over a little thing like this, eh?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"We left him behind..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Ain't that the honest truth."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"What do you want?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gambino","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"Hmph... I'm sick of you scuttling around like cockroaches, getting into my business, makin' yourselves a real pain in my tail."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gambino","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"That's the value of the little prince here. I got a hostage and all you can do is take me head on."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gambino","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"And that'll save me a lotta trouble. That turns my little penguin problem into a very solvable problem."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gambino","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"Penguin Logistics got nowhere to run."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"Yeah, okay. Great. Just the way I like it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gambino","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"...What?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"Turns out we're thinking in the same direction."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"Croissant, Sora, form up."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"Exusiai, cover us."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"Let's get our Bison back."},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_101_sora","aliases":["Sora"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["Texas"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["Exusiai"]},{"speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","aliases":["Croissant"]},{"speakerId":"char_325_bison","aliases":["Bison"]}]}
